<td>Probably not<a name="ft14" href="/web/20070613122040/https://www.cia.gov/library/center-for-the-study-of-intelligence/csi-publications/books-and-monographs/sherman-kent-and-the-board-of-national-estimates-collected-essays/6words.html#rft14"><strong>(14)</strong></a></td>
